@page "/support"

<PageTitle>Support | It's About Bloody Time</PageTitle>

<section class="event-page information-page support-page">
    <div class="page-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Help with your archive</p>
        <h1>Support</h1>
        <p class="page-introduction">A quick guide to creating and caring for the timelines and events in your archive.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="support-guide">
        <section class="support-card">
            <p class="support-card-label">Timelines</p>
            <h2>Create and manage a timeline</h2>
            <ol class="support-steps">
                <li>
                    <strong>Create a timeline.</strong>
                    From the Home page, select <strong>Create timeline</strong>. Add a title and description to explain the story you are preserving, then optionally choose a cover image.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Edit its details.</strong>
                    Open the timeline editor and select <strong>Edit Details</strong> to update the title, description, or cover image.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Delete it carefully.</strong>
                    Select <strong>Delete Timeline</strong> in the editor and confirm the prompt. This permanently removes the timeline, every event in it, and their images.
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="support-card">
            <p class="support-card-label">Events</p>
            <h2>Add and update events</h2>
            <ol class="support-steps">
                <li>
                    <strong>Add an event.</strong>
                    In the timeline editor, select <strong>Add event</strong>. Give it a title, short summary, full description, start date, and end date. You can also attach an image.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Review an event.</strong>
                    Select a row in the event table to open its preview. The preview shows the image, dates, summary, and full description together.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Edit or remove an event.</strong>
                    Use <strong>Edit</strong> in the preview to change its details, or <strong>Delete</strong> to remove it after confirmation. Select <strong>Close</strong> to return to the full-width table.
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="support-card support-card-wide">
            <p class="support-card-label">Explore</p>
            <h2>Find and view your history</h2>
            <div class="support-tips">
                <p><strong>Find a timeline:</strong> Use the search field on the Home page to filter timelines by title or description as you type.</p>
                <p><strong>Render a timeline:</strong> Select <strong>Render Timeline</strong> in the editor to explore events on a date-based visual timeline. Use its horizontal scrollbar to explore longer periods.</p>
                <p><strong>Keep entries useful:</strong> Write a short summary for quick scanning, then use the full description to capture the details and context worth returning to.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</section>
